From 13d4425dbf04923de9f697916c2b02e7b3cd49da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NEMO executor <executor@nemo.local>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 20:49:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] coag: anchor diffusion convergence to the v1 fiducial
 grid (5nm-0.5um)

Re-run Part B 1d/1e on the production size range so the coarse endpoint IS the
20-bin fiducial grid (mass_ratio sweep 2.0/1.5/1.3/1.15 -> 20/35/53/99 bins),
instead of fixture_dust_coag's 16-75. Justify mass_ratio + size span in the
paper, not a bin count; 20 bins = fiducial (mass_ratio=2).

Gate PASS (monotone L1, both kernels) on the fiducial range:
  constant cont-L1 0.371>0.226>0.149>0.093 ; disc-L1 0.283>0.140>0.066>0.057
  additive cont-L1 0.388>0.232>0.154>0.105 ; disc-L1 0.299>0.150>0.080>0.068

coag_diffusion.py defaults -> a_min=5e-7, a_max=5e-5, m0_radius=1e-6.
Figure + data TSVs regenerated on this range.
